<item>
<title>Pakistan and Afghanistan: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/afghanistan-pakistan/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-afghanistan-pakistan-2026-11-19T03:43:48.459Z</guid>
<pubDate>Thu, 19 Nov 2026 03:43:48 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Taliban forces demolished the entrance of a mosque in Maidan Wardak, while Russia expanded diplomatic contacts with the Taliban-led Afghan government. A Pakistani bank’s exit has cut a vital lifeline for Afghanistan’s banking sector, and a Russian military aircraft crashed, killing 19 people. In Pakistan, a high-voltage cable fell on a house in Turbat, killing a woman; a policeman was killed in Bannu; and two civilians died in a roadside blast in Zhob. Saudi Delta Energy announced a $30 billion gas infrastructure investment. The conflict recorded 1,794 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://reliefweb.int/report/republic-north-macedonia/dtm-north-macedonia-migration-data-and-routes-quarterly-report-july-september-2026&quot;&gt;ReliefWeb (OCHA)&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://reliefweb.int/report/northern-mariana-islands-united-states-america/north-macedonia-kvartalen-izveshtaj-juli-septemvri-2026-mk&quot;&gt;ReliefWeb (OCHA)&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://reliefweb.int/report/serbia/dtm-serbia-migration-data-and-routes-quarterly-report-july-september-2026&quot;&gt;ReliefWeb (OCHA)&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://reliefweb.int/report/serbia/serbia-migracioni-podaci-i-rute-q3-jul-septembar-2026-sr&quot;&gt;ReliefWeb (OCHA)&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://reliefweb.int/report/albania/western-balkans-migration-routes-dynamics-quarterly-report-july-september-2026&quot;&gt;ReliefWeb (OCHA)&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://reliefweb.int/report/turkiye/mpm-turkiye-overview-migrant-situation-migrant-presence-monitoring-quarterly-report-q3-july-august-september-2026&quot;&gt;ReliefWeb (OCHA)&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiSEFVX3lxTE9lbGcxYjFOUVBFUlRTZU1rYnlxTmRoeDF4QWFFOUpIUE5GcHBjN3dvc2Q0OUp6WWJTZU1GVGZkczdoa2hCc1p2NA?oc=5&